German learning app LinGo Play is an interesting and effective vocabulary trainer to learn German words and phrases through flashcards and online games. Download the German learning app LinGo Play and try it!

The LinGo German course includes the following topics: Education, Business, People, Home, Nature, Animals, Science, Sports and Tourism, Art, Food, Appliances, Furniture, Beauty and Health, Medicine, as well as many other topics…

Learn the German language through LinGo's many features:
 ‣ 5172 flashcards, 4141 words, 373 phrases;
